{"2019300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dokimon Quest", "steam_appid": 2019300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3314520], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dokimon Quest</strong> is a turn-based monster-taming RPG set in a GameBoy Color-inspired pixel world. Capture, train, and battle alongside 140+ original monsters as you push into a dangerous open world to uncover the mystery behind your missing childhood friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/6d1fe350c6ffb60150b3a7a1acc7399e.avif?t=1787586999\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras_big/6d1fe350c6ffb60150b3a7a1acc7399e.avif?t=1787586999 width=800 height=518 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Whoa, watch out!&quot;</i> Dokimon may be dangerous, but don't let that stop you! The more you explore, the stronger you'll need to become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quality of Life Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed up battles by holding an action key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit monster stats and move pools from your main menu (when in towns)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle helper tips and tools (<strong>optional</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest log, to help you keep track of your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-bit + Piano OST</strong> — pick whichever suits your preference</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World battles let you battle right in your surroundings (enable in options)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ retro color palettes, in case full color isn't your style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 playable characters</strong> to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 save files, in case your friends want to try</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against Rangers who are also on the quest to get stronger, and take down evil corporations that stand in your way and disrupt the peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/71e230e08699e9a04a3ada568a74d579.gif?t=1787586999\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/71e230e08699e9a04a3ada568a74d579.poster.avif?t=1787586999\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dokimon takes inspiration from the GameBoy Color era of games, without the chunkiness of some of those old systems. (Like, the game's systems... not the consoles — we love those.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On Your Adventure</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect over 140 unique</strong>, original monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an adventure spanning <strong>15+ towns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore several routes, caves, shrines, seas, and mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a <strong>15–20 hour story mode</strong>, with endless post-game content for completionists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down rare monsters to unlock the <strong>game's post-story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience 7 alt-palettes for each monster (1 of which is incredibly rare)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go FISHING!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built on the MonMae Engine (aka Luna)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/b1c3c9f24f18fb9d1d52376f3db13603.avif?t=1787586999\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dokimon Quest was made in MonTamer Maker (MonMae, also known as Luna), a platform/engine built specifically for making monster tamer games. The engine keeps growing thanks to its devs and community — so making new Dokimon Quest (and similar) titles is within arm's reach, even for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Professor Intro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Watch out!&quot;</i> &quot;You almost just got singed by a Burnsby!! Didn't you know? They may be cute and cuddly, but they hide amongst plush animals, and strike out at unsuspecting prey. Their cute demeanor can quickly send you on a trip to the hospital!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/67641adc540620f7040fde84eb3a5789.avif?t=1787586999\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professor Rei: &quot;Oh, hey! I didn't see you there. I was practicing my lines for... err, nevermind.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My name is Rei! I've made a bit of a name for myself as a Dokimon specialist. Ever since the <strong>Great Divide</strong>, I've made it my mission to thoroughly document Dokimon on Earth. Dokimon are extremely dangerous creatures, so studying them profusely helps ensure everyone's safety. You probably already knew that, though...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;But anyway, what are you still doing here? Go play the game already!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/de478f000c903955ac0c6d15e8cd499f.avif?t=1787586999\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/69cb729f89d61f103a6e64053da64cb3.avif?t=1787586999\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras_big/69cb729f89d61f103a6e64053da64cb3.avif?t=1787586999 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >p.s. There is a <strong>Dokimon Wiki</strong> with information about <strong>all monsters, tips, guides,</strong> and more. If you're interested, check the Dokimon Quest Steam Community Hub, or search &quot;Dokimon Wiki&quot; in your favorite search engine.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dokimon Quest</strong> is a turn-based monster-taming RPG set in a GameBoy Color-inspired pixel world. Capture, train, and battle alongside 140+ original monsters as you push into a dangerous open world to uncover the mystery behind your missing childhood friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/6d1fe350c6ffb60150b3a7a1acc7399e.avif?t=1787586999\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras_big/6d1fe350c6ffb60150b3a7a1acc7399e.avif?t=1787586999 width=800 height=518 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Whoa, watch out!&quot;</i> Dokimon may be dangerous, but don't let that stop you! The more you explore, the stronger you'll need to become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quality of Life Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed up battles by holding an action key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit monster stats and move pools from your main menu (when in towns)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle helper tips and tools (<strong>optional</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest log, to help you keep track of your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-bit + Piano OST</strong> — pick whichever suits your preference</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World battles let you battle right in your surroundings (enable in options)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ retro color palettes, in case full color isn't your style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 playable characters</strong> to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 save files, in case your friends want to try</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against Rangers who are also on the quest to get stronger, and take down evil corporations that stand in your way and disrupt the peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/71e230e08699e9a04a3ada568a74d579.gif?t=1787586999\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/71e230e08699e9a04a3ada568a74d579.poster.avif?t=1787586999\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dokimon takes inspiration from the GameBoy Color era of games, without the chunkiness of some of those old systems. (Like, the game's systems... not the consoles — we love those.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On Your Adventure</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect over 140 unique</strong>, original monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an adventure spanning <strong>15+ towns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore several routes, caves, shrines, seas, and mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a <strong>15–20 hour story mode</strong>, with endless post-game content for completionists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down rare monsters to unlock the <strong>game's post-story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience 7 alt-palettes for each monster (1 of which is incredibly rare)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go FISHING!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built on the MonMae Engine (aka Luna)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/b1c3c9f24f18fb9d1d52376f3db13603.avif?t=1787586999\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dokimon Quest was made in MonTamer Maker (MonMae, also known as Luna), a platform/engine built specifically for making monster tamer games. The engine keeps growing thanks to its devs and community — so making new Dokimon Quest (and similar) titles is within arm's reach, even for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Professor Intro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Watch out!&quot;</i> &quot;You almost just got singed by a Burnsby!! Didn't you know? They may be cute and cuddly, but they hide amongst plush animals, and strike out at unsuspecting prey. Their cute demeanor can quickly send you on a trip to the hospital!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/67641adc540620f7040fde84eb3a5789.avif?t=1787586999\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professor Rei: &quot;Oh, hey! I didn't see you there. I was practicing my lines for... err, nevermind.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My name is Rei! I've made a bit of a name for myself as a Dokimon specialist. Ever since the <strong>Great Divide</strong>, I've made it my mission to thoroughly document Dokimon on Earth. Dokimon are extremely dangerous creatures, so studying them profusely helps ensure everyone's safety. You probably 